        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, sweet, burned in production flare</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, sweet, burned in production flare
CO2 and CO emissions from a global model, other emissions based on data for NO and own estimations.;
7e9ad35b-eb88-3146-8224-cfd4a2558b4a
Emissions of (sweet) gas flaring. Excluded are SO2-, Nox- and CH4-emissions. They need to be assessed separately
Location:  Global average.
Technology: Burning of natural gas in production flare.
Time period: Time of estimation.
Production volume: Total flaring (sweet+sour) ~150 billion m3 of natural gas in 2019
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: From country data to global situation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7e9ad35b-eb88-3146-8224-cfd4a2558b4a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
